    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάτροκλος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Patroclus</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, who has also obl. cases from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατροκλῆς
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλέης</span>), viz. gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατροκλῆος</span>, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατροκλῆα</span>, voc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατρόκλεες</span> : gen. pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατρόκλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1041
				</span></i>
			 : nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατροκλῆς</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.140
			</span></i> : <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πατρόκλεια</span></b> , ἡ, name of the sixteenth book of the Iliad,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				13.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1041.19
			</span></i>.</div>
